{"name":"气泡确认框","description":"触发危险或关键操作时在控件就近浮现的目标二次确认浮层。 · 移除一个可恢复的标签时可在按钮旁确认“确定移除吗？”。永久删除或转账等高风险操作需要更完整说明，应使用 弹窗 Modal 。 先知道 气泡卡片 Popover 弹窗 Modal","quote":"点删除时在按钮旁边冒一句“确定吗”，别直接弹大窗。","agentPrompt":"项目归档请使用靠近触发按钮的 Popconfirm，明确写出项目名和“团队将不再默认看到它”，并提供取消。分别取消一次和确认一次，确认取消不改变数据、确认后列表状态更新且可恢复。","html":"<div class=\"detail-body detail-entry-popconfirm\"><section class=\"detail-hero\" id=\"detail-hero\"><div class=\"dh-head\"><h1>气泡确认框<span>Popconfirm</span></h1></div><div class=\"dh-quote\"><span class=\"dh-quote-label\">你可能会说</span><p class=\"dh-quote-text\">点删除时在按钮旁边冒一句“确定吗”，别直接弹大窗。</p></div><div class=\"dh-tagline\"><strong class=\"dh-summary-lead\">触发危险或关键操作时在控件就近浮现的目标二次确认浮层。</strong><span class=\"dh-summary-separator\" aria-hidden=\"true\">·</span><span>移除一个可恢复的标签时可在按钮旁确认“确定移除吗？”。永久删除或转账等高风险操作需要更完整说明，应使用<a class=\"c-ref c-link\" href=\"/vibe-hub/modal?lang=zh\" data-ref=\"modal\" aria-label=\"弹窗 Modal\">弹窗 <b>Modal</b></a>。</span><div class=\"prerequisite-row\" aria-label=\"先知道\"><span class=\"prerequisite-label\">先知道</span><div class=\"prerequisite-links\"><a class=\"c-ref c-link\" href=\"/vibe-hub/popover?lang=zh\" data-ref=\"popover\">气泡卡片 <b>Popover</b></a><a class=\"c-ref c-link\" href=\"/vibe-hub/modal?lang=zh\" data-ref=\"modal\">弹窗 <b>Modal</b></a></div></div></div><div class=\"alias-row\" aria-label=\"也常被叫作\"><span>也常被叫作</span><em>气泡确认框</em><em>就近确认框</em><em>行内确认</em></div><div class=\"dh-demo\"><div class=\"dh-demo-viewport\"><div class=\"dh-demo-inner\"><div class=\"popconfirm-demo\"><div class=\"popconfirm-card\"><div class=\"popconfirm-text\"><i>⚠</i><span>确认删除这条记录？</span></div><div class=\"popconfirm-actions\"><span class=\"btn btn-outline\">取消</span><span class=\"btn btn-primary\">确定</span></div></div><div class=\"popconfirm-arrow\"></div><span class=\"btn btn-danger\">删除</span></div></div></div></div></section><div class=\"lesson-extras\"><section class=\"lesson-agent-prompt\" aria-labelledby=\"lesson-agent-title\"><h2 id=\"lesson-agent-title\">你可以这样告诉 AI Agent</h2><blockquote><span class=\"lesson-agent-quote\" aria-hidden=\"true\">“</span><p>项目归档请使用靠近触发按钮的 Popconfirm，明确写出项目名和“团队将不再默认看到它”，并提供取消。分别取消一次和确认一次，确认取消不改变数据、确认后列表状态更新且可恢复。</p></blockquote></section></div><div class=\"usage-grid\"><div class=\"usage-box use\"><h3><span class=\"mark\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m5 12.5 4.2 4.2L19 7\"></path></svg></span>什么时候用</h3><ul><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\"><b>可恢复的轻量操作</b>：误点会麻烦，但后果容易撤销</div><div class=\"mk \"><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center\"><div style=\"background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:6px;box-shadow:0 4px 14px rgba(29,33,41,.14);padding:6px 8px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:5px;max-width:150px\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text)\">⚠ 确认删除这条记录？</span><div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:flex-end;gap:4px\"><span class=\"mk-btn outline\">取消</span><span class=\"mk-btn primary\">确定</span></div></div><div style=\"width:0;height:0;border:5px solid transparent;border-top-color:var(--bg)\"></div><span class=\"mk-btn danger\" style=\"margin-top:1px\">删除</span></div></div></li><li class=\"has-usage-mock\"><div class=\"usage-text\"><b>列表行内操作</b>：在当前上下文中完成确认</div><div class=\"mk \"><div class=\"mk-scene\"><div class=\"mk-skel\"><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:80%\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:60%\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:70%\"></i></div><div style=\"position:absolute;left:50%;top:50%;transform:translate(-50%,-50%);background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:6px;box-shadow:0 4px 14px rgba(29,33,41,.14);padding:6px 8px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:5px;width:60%\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text)\">确认删除？</span><div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:flex-end;gap:4px\"><span class=\"mk-btn outline\">取消</span><span class=\"mk-btn primary\">确定</span></div></div></div></div><